    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27558" root="ظعن" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَعُونٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>used for work and for bearing
burdens:</i> (S, K, TA:) or, as some say, peculiarly,
[like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَعِينَةٌ</span>,] a camel <i>that is ridden by a woman.</i>
(TA.) ＝   
